                            <comment id="17575280" author="ivandasch" created="Thu, 4 Aug 2022 13:50:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;After merging &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-15436&quot; title=&quot;Calcite engine. Merge Calcite SQL Engine to Ignite 2.x&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-15436&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-15436&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; ANALYZE, REFRESH and DROP were broken even for H2. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17190&quot; title=&quot;Calcite engine. Unbind statistics from H2&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-17190&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-17190&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; fixes this issue, it is required only to add support in CALCITE for these commands here.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
